rominence chosen most for N1 and, under single choice, open views into the wider space for N4. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper's first six questions on the need for a window and the importance of a good view are not included because their wording is not printed; (2) the paper gave the two approaches to two separate student groups (architecture students in a Moodle classroom, urbanism students on 1KA, both online in May 2022); here the approach is randomly assigned and anyone can take part; (3) the question wording, the instruction text and the view order (N1 to N5, as numbered in the paper) are ours; (4) the field-of-study question is ours; (5) the photographs are the figure copies (about 600 px wide), not the 2592 x 1944 px originals.",
